@page "/roof-repair-charlotte-nc"
@{
    ViewData["Lang"] = "en";
    ViewData["SeoEn"] = "/roof-repair-charlotte-nc";
    ViewData["SeoEs"] = "/es/reparacion-de-techo-charlotte-nc";
    ViewData["SeoAlert"] = "Active leak or missing shingles?";
}
<main class="resource-site" lang="en">
    @await Html.PartialAsync("_SeoIntentHeader")
    <section class="resource-hero systems-hero">
        <div class="site-shell">
            <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Roof repair Charlotte NC</p>
            <h1>Roof Repair in Charlotte, NC</h1>
            <p>Licensed and insured roof repair for leaks, missing shingles, flashing, fascia and storm damage across Charlotte, NC and Rock Hill, SC. Free inspection by address. Same-business-day response—not a same-day repair promise.</p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
                <a class="button button-gold" href="#contact">Request a roof repair inspection</a>
                <a class="button button-ghost" href="tel:+19808005991">Call (980) 800-5991</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="resource-body section" id="process">
        <div class="site-shell resource-sections">
            <article><span>01</span><div>
                <h2>What roof repair near me actually includes</h2>
                <p>Majestic diagnoses the roof as a system: shingles, flashing, valleys, pipe boots, vents, decking clues and interior stains. Isolated patches fail when water starts upslope of the stain. After a safe inspection we recommend the smallest reliable repair—or a replacement when the roof is too worn to patch.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Roof leak repair and active water entry</li>
                    <li>Missing, lifted or wind-damaged shingles</li>
                    <li>Chimney, wall and penetration flashing</li>
                    <li>Emergency tarp when access and weather allow</li>
                </ul>
            </div></article>
            <article><span>02</span><div>
                <h2>Repair estimate, not a guess from the street</h2>
                <p>A roof repair cost depends on access, pitch, material match, decking and how far water has traveled. We do not publish a fake “starting at” number that ignores those facts. You receive a written contractor scope after the inspection. Hidden damage, permits and code upgrades are called out separately.</p>
            </div></article>
            <article><span>03</span><div>
                <h2>Charlotte weather and when repair is not enough</h2>
                <p>Repeated leaks, widespread granule loss, sagging, or a roof near the end of its life often need replacement rather than another patch. Compare paths on <a class="official-link" href="/repair-or-replace-roof">repair vs replace</a>, then start with <a class="official-link" href="/roof-replacement-charlotte-nc">roof replacement in Charlotte</a> or <a class="official-link" href="/free-roof-inspection-charlotte-nc">a free roof inspection</a>.</p>
            </div></article>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="faq-section section" id="faq">
        <div class="site-shell faq-layout">
            <div><p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p><h2>Roof repair questions</h2></div>
            <div class="faq-list">
                <details><summary>Do you offer same day roof repair?<span>+</span></summary><p>Majestic aims for same-business-day response. Repair itself depends on safe access, weather, materials and the actual damage. Emergency tarping may be the first step when the roof is open or leaking.</p></details>
                <details><summary>Does insurance cover roof repair?<span>+</span></summary><p>Coverage depends on the policy and whether the damage is a covered peril versus wear. Majestic documents visible conditions. The homeowner files the claim; the carrier decides payment. See the <a href="/roof-insurance-claim-charlotte-nc">roof insurance claim</a> guide.</p></details>
                <details><summary>Can leaking roof stains be patched from inside?<span>+</span></summary><p>Interior paint does not stop the leak. The roof source has to be found. Ceiling stains often sit away from the opening. We inspect accessible roof and attic clues before recommending a repair.</p></details>
                <details><summary>Is Majestic a licensed and insured roof repair contractor?<span>+</span></summary><p>Yes. Majestic Roofing, Inc. is a fully insured bilingual contractor serving properties about 90 minutes from Charlotte or Rock Hill. Raleigh is outside the service area.</p></details>
                <details><summary>What if shingles keep blowing off?<span>+</span></summary><p>Wind can break the seal before a shingle disappears. We inspect attachment, surrounding slopes and whether a local repair will hold. Widespread wind damage may need replacement and claim documentation.</p></details>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    @await Html.PartialAsync("_SeoIntentFooter")
</main>
